au ISBN; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/2039918/de-maltezer-valk.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00Z","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-04-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/2039918/de-maltezer-valk.html","sha256":"dba2c78b068947e75dcd783ff2cbbe61e91e4c16989eee22cf82373bec99c84e","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T14:01:09.296Z","fact":"Paperback ISBN 9789044552690 verschijningsdatum 05/03/2026 NUR 330 Spannende boeken algemeen imprint De Geus uitgever Singel Uitgeverijen taal Nederlands","sourceAuthors":"Dashiell Hammett","identityNote":"Same canonical Work, translation attached to existing identity; no author/Work merge."}]}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789044620443","key":{"isbn_13":"9789044620443"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":62,"title":"De naam van de roos","language":"nld","isbn_13":"9789044620443","isbn_10":null,"open_library_edition_id":null,"publisher":"Prometheus, Uitgeverij"}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789044620443","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789044620443"},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789044620443","work_id":62,"bound_author_id":52,"bound_title":"De naam van de roos","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789044620443","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000008617_De_naam_van_de_roos_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/45973/de-naam-van-de-roos.html","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00Z","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-04-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/45973/de-naam-van-de-roos.html","sha256":"09a4614b6c473b2f74038d390f4ee152ed815d56f070084c0c062bc19c9f0915","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T14:01:42.155Z","fact":"Paperback ISBN 9789044620443 verschijningsdatum 30/03/2012 NUR 302 Vertaalde literaire roman, novelle imprint Prometheus uitgever Prometheus, Uitgeverij taal Nederlands","sourceAuthors":"Umberto Eco","identityNote":"Same canonical Work, translation attached to existing identity; no author/Work merge."},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000008617_De_naam_van_de_roos_0_0.jpg","sha256":"88e6123e38cb7ad30985d348a7ffe6419ad2d885007b18371c134b7d6a172077","bytes":77639,"checkedAt":"2026-11-01T14:20:02.186Z","fact":"Exact ISBN block image + human visual title/author review, sheet3"}]}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:62","key":{"work_id":62,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":62,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":52,"text":"In 1327 arriveert de franciscaner monnik William Baskerville met zijn metgezel Adson in een welvarende Italiaanse abdij. Zijn diplomatieke opdracht raakt op de achtergrond wanneer er raadselachtige misdaden plaatsvinden. De moeilijk toegankelijke bibliotheek lijkt daarbij van belang. William onderzoekt aanwijzingen en tegenstrijdige verklaringen, terwijl de bewoners hun eigen belangen beschermen. De zoektocht speelt zich af binnen een wereld van religieuze spanningen, kennis en zorgvuldig bewaarde geheimen.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/45973/de-naam-van-de-roos.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00Z","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-04-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/45973/de-naam-van-de-roos.html","sha256":"09a4614b6c473b2f74038d390f4ee152ed815d56f070084c0c062bc19c9f0915","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T14:01:42.155Z","fact":"Paperback ISBN 9789044620443 verschijningsdatum 30/03/2012 NUR 302 Vertaalde literaire roman, novelle imprint Prometheus uitgever Prometheus, Uitgeverij taal Nederlands","sourceAuthors":"Umberto Eco","identityNote":"Same canonical Work, translation attached to existing identity; no author/Work merge."}]}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789022554029","key":{"isbn_13":"9789022554029"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":66,"title":"De vrouw van de tijdreiziger","language":"nld","isbn_13":"9789022554029","isbn_10":null,"open_library_edition_id":null,"publisher":"Meulenhoff Boekerij B.V."}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789022554029","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789022554029"},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789022554029","work_id":66,"bound_author_id":56,"bound_title":"De vrouw van de tijdreiziger","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789022554029","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000057941_vrouw_van_de_tijdreiziger_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/257153/vrouw-van-de-tijdreiziger.html","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00Z","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-04-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/257153/vrouw-van-de-tijdreiziger.html","sha256":"a140f6630dc68aebcd7ecc629bf0e5f46f8d80a4233da2a0dabde8fc0cf5289e","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T14:01:48.549Z","fact":"Paperback ISBN 9789022554029 verschijningsdatum 01/12/2009 NUR 302 Vertaalde literaire roman, novelle imprint Boekerij uitgever Meulenhoff Boekerij B.V. taal Nederlands","sourceAuthors":"Audrey Niffenegger","identityNote":"Same canonical Work, translation attached to existing identity; no author/Work merge."},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000057941_vrouw_van_de_tijdreiziger_0_0.jpg","sha256":"ed1e4d08d946d33fd78ebd0f2ac0bc87d04b2a414de3be3d2b5807981c7cf2eb","bytes":72624,"checkedAt":"2026-11-01T14:20:03.485Z","fact":"Exact ISBN block image + human visual title/author review, sheet3"}]}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:66","key":{"work_id":66,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":66,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":56,"text":"Clare studeert kunstgeschiedenis en Henry werkt als bibliothecaris. Hun liefde wordt bemoeilijkt doordat Henry zich ongewild door de tijd verplaatst, vooral op emotioneel ingrijpende momenten. Daardoor beleven zij hun gezamenlijke geschiedenis niet steeds op dezelfde manier. Zij proberen toch een leven met elkaar op te bouwen. De roman volgt hoe nabijheid, wachten en onzekerheid hun verhouding bepalen wanneer gewone afspraken over tijd niet betrouwbaar blijken.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/257153/vrouw-van-de-tijdreiziger.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00Z","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-04-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/257153/vrouw-van-de-tijdreiziger.html","sha256":"a140f6630dc68aebcd7ecc629bf0e5f46f8d80a4233da2a0dabde8fc0cf5289e","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T14:01:48.549Z","fact":"Paperback ISBN 9789022554029 verschijningsdatum 01/12/2009 NUR 302 Vertaalde literaire roman, novelle imprint Boekerij uitgever Meulenhoff Boekerij B.V. taal Nederlands","sourceAuthors":"Audrey Niffenegger","identityNote":"Same canonical Work, translation attached to existing identity; no author/Work merge."}]}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789025775759","key":{"isbn_13":"9789025775759"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":67,"title":"Een weeffout in onze sterren","language":"nld","isbn_13":"9789025775759","isbn_10":null,"open_library_edition_id":null,"publisher":"Gottmer Uitgevers Groep b.v."}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789025775759","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789025775759"},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789025775759","work_id":67,"bound_author_id":57,"bound_title":"Een weeffout in onze sterren","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789025775759","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000343131_Een_weeffout_in_onze_sterren_0_0.